{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，S05、S11、S13等段落的感受词和话句拆分略显密集，而且S06把“对方不知道他刚才多怕被嫌弃”的孤单改写成“怕自己要得太多”，部分心理动机出现偏移。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把叙事拆成短行，用加亮词突出每段的心理转折，感受词缩小并按音乐进程出现，普通观众更容易边听边扫，抓住故事主线。反复出现的水波、船、摇荡、靠岸等意象也让前后形成了连贯的整体，感受比X更具体、更贴近音乐的细微变化。X的完整句子在解释人物动机、保留心理因果关系方面更稳，尤其没有像Y那样在部分段落改变人物原本的心理侧重点。总体而言，Y的观看体验更好，但需要控制局部信息密度和改写幅度。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0147592b-9308-4edb-ad3b-f87f5e0cd434", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T213449943516Z", "elapsed_seconds": 77.078, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T21:36:07.031167+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "fe946c3125bd63fa5f7cac73c2e4d63ac3b871e230e17d91af61a41e21842d86", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3f